  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a26737aec160a2d",
      "translationZh": "AIE NYC 的门票即将售罄！下周见！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaa4f58e499e702f",
      "translationZh": "查看过去的 AINews 期刊以获取订阅者折扣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d705816e47a822be",
      "translationZh": "为 Mistral 倒一杯，他们在最近的 Series D 资助的全新 3800 GB300 集群上发布了一个不错的 Large 4 “Le Chonk” 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98c42664a3f2d6cd",
      "translationZh": "但他们被 OpenAI 内部的 Navier-Stokes 数学模型所掩盖——该模型以博客文章、代码库和推文的形式发布。来自 Anthropic 的 Navier-Stokes 竞争者尽管与 OpenAI 有个人分歧，却毫不掩饰地说道：“这显然是数学史上最重要的时刻。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5106271bb6c8bf62",
      "translationZh": "这虽然有一些限制，但大多数专家似乎同意它解决了数学中前 500 个开放问题中的许多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e6766b2ef1d2b78",
      "translationZh": "特别是，结果 003，即准黎曼假设，介于菲尔兹奖级别的成果与“过去 200 年数论领域最大的成果”之间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c56f1b6039e441d9",
      "translationZh": "最令人惊讶的是——Navier-Stokes 用了 88 小时和 10,000 个代理，而这些解决方案平均仅需 3 小时的 ChatGPT Pro。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "696d6c0098fa59c5",
      "translationZh": "AI News 10/5/2026-10/6/2026。我们检查了 12 个 subreddits，544 条 Twitters，没有进一步的 Discords。AINews’ 网站让您可以搜索所有过去的期刊。提醒大家，AINews 现在是 Latent Space 的一个章节。您可以选择订阅或退订邮件频率。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df78d900f5dd8e9c",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 发布了来自未发布内部模型的 722 篇数学手稿",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e315966ad289a48f",
      "translationZh": "发布概况：OpenAI 在一个公开的 GitHub 仓库中发布了来自内部前沿模型的大量数学研究成果。该公司表示，就如何发布这些成果咨询了高级研究所数学与人工智能独立顾问小组的意见。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dd1e311a245738b",
      "translationZh": "规模与算力：据报道，该合集包含 722 篇手稿，按相关成果的 372 个系列进行分组。它们来自对约 4000 个研究问题的评估，每个成果平均消耗了大约三小时的 ChatGPT Pro 思考算力（摘要，Rundown）。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "066fb01fae780c03",
      "translationZh": "产出成果：此次发布包括论文、证明产物以及精选的推理摘要。该模型本身仍未发布。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3860444611843b63",
      "translationZh": "定性：Sam Altman 称之为“发现的新时代”。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1f6f746996b7070",
      "translationZh": "值得注意的声称结果：这些是由个别评论员报告的，尚未经过独立验证。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2a42c71374beb8c",
      "translationZh": "整数乘法：一位贡献者指出了一个比 n log n 更快的整数乘法结果。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5778e56716307735",
      "translationZh": "弹性反问题：另一个人挑出了弹性反问题的一个唯一性结果，论文称该问题自 1994 年以来在 3D 领域一直未解。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "979bf6b8effc8e45",
      "translationZh": "走近千禧年难题的工作：评论者指出在黎曼猜想、霍奇猜想和BSD猜想上取得了部分进展。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6cbe20e1edb03fb",
      "translationZh": "数学家的反应：勒文·阿尔伯格（Levent Alpöge）赞扬了拟黎曼和无西格尔零点结果，并称其为“数学史上最重大的时刻”。他还指出，涉及其他实验室用户的报道中存在抢跑和利益冲突问题。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dff69a87f7a18306",
      "translationZh": "成果组成：一项分析估计，大约20%的结果是反证或反例。该分析认为，这削弱了关于AI数学成果主要靠暴力搜索的说法。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "657ebc4097539ca4",
      "translationZh": "怀疑态度与未决问题：",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "720b0d5d561ce702",
      "translationZh": "预期的错误：Will Depue 认为有些结果应经不起审查。他建立了 citedbyagi.com 来追踪该发布引用了哪些人类论文。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "534791305f0a2488",
      "translationZh": "计算框架：Teortaxes 指出三小时的计算“并不算多”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2124517c583c7a1",
      "translationZh": "泛化：François Chollet 询问在 RLVR-friendly 的数学和代码中的提升是否能够泛化，或者不可验证的领域是否仍然受限于人类数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2603c5bbff0b3132",
      "translationZh": "Mistral Large 4（“Le Chonk”）：发布、定价和有争议的评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5dbbf822c26757c",
      "translationZh": "Mistral Large 4 预览：该模型总参数量为 1T，活跃参数 49B，原生多模态，现已通过 API 提供（公告）。开放权重承诺在十月底发布。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e12fbc0e5a5d22cf",
      "translationZh": "训练状态：RL 运行“仍在进行中且未见饱和迹象”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50fc85d68a835d02",
      "translationZh": "计算：该模型在欧洲约 3,800 块 Grace Blackwell 上进行了预训练和后训练。目前正在训练一个更大的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b53d339e733a6805",
      "translationZh": "定价：每百万输入/输出 token 为 1.36/4.18，缓存输入为 0.14，前两周享受 50% 折扣（Artificial Analysis）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f7188144eb8f8ea",
      "translationZh": "Context : Vals 和 Artificial Analysis 列出 512K 上下文窗口。OpenRouter 列出 1M 上下文，最高可达 256K 输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5facbcc8f9e9b20",
      "translationZh": "Human evals : Mistral 表示它在 STEM、CAD 和 金融的人类评测中击败 GLM 5.3，在 agentic coding 方面持平。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59001d429e3afd72",
      "translationZh": "Coding benchmarks : 它报道在 DeepSWE 上超越 GLM 5.3，并在 Terminal-Bench 4（Rozière）上超越 Kimi K3。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf7d6d9e212e67b8",
      "translationZh": "Blind review : 在一次盲测 Surge 编码评测中，它排名第 2，仅次于 Opus 5。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aef522deb429e48b",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis : 它在 Intelligence Index 上得分 38，与 GPT-6 Luna（最大值）持平，并且是美国和中国以外的最高得分。它在 Cyber Index 上得分 50，在 CyberGym-E2E-AA 上达到 82%。每项任务成本为 1.13，是同等智能开放模型的 4 倍以上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e56017592ca75de7",
      "translationZh": "Vals : 它在 HLAB 上的开放权重排名第 1，在 Vals Index 上的开放模型中排名第 9。大量使用上下文使其每测试成本升至 13.78。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c611ce2229a307d8",
      "translationZh": "Clinical triage : 一位评估者报告在 669 项临床决策中并列第 1，且没有严重失误。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d30363393363259c",
      "translationZh": "注意事项和分歧：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84f3dc11a5d0876a",
      "translationZh": "拒绝效应：Cline 将网络领先主要归因于更少的拒绝，称 Opus 5.5 和 Astra 有大约 40% 的任务被其自身安全过滤器阻止。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc76fc860eb50ad9",
      "translationZh": "指数差距：评论家指出它在 AA 指数上落后于 GLM-5.3，甚至落后于 GLM-5.3-Flash。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a36f908d029bdae",
      "translationZh": "开放权重声明：Hugging Face 的 CEO 指出，直到权重发布之前它并不是开放权重。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "080f17ddb721df15",
      "translationZh": "配置：Mistral 警告，许多报告的失败源于未将 reasoning_effort 设置为 \"high\"。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cca447e8e197099",
      "translationZh": "蒸馏假设：Yuchen Jin 推测，作为未经证实的观点，西方-中国开放模型差距反映了中国实验室提炼 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 模型的能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7515ce7251b557b",
      "translationZh": "开放权重和 API 模型发布：嵌入、图像、决策模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "121cd81ddab578ce",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2：Google 首个原生多模态开放嵌入模型，覆盖文本、代码、图像、视频和音频，统一在一个空间。它基于 Gemma 4 构建，并在 Apache 2.0 许可下发布（DeepMind）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd5fcbadc5fd66aa",
      "translationZh": "规格：它是模块化的，具有 740M 全模态、440M 文本+视觉、570M 文本+音频和 270M 仅文本变体。它具有从 768 降到 128 的 Matryoshka 维度，8,192 上下文长度，并在 MTEB Code 上报告提升 +14%（Phil Schmid）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b5aa89fa86ca443",
      "translationZh": "占用空间：它大约使用 191–567MB 的活动 RAM，并且每次通过可以处理最多 5.5 分钟的音频或 58 视频帧（Google）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9484f605ba5a7c14",
      "translationZh": "生态系统：Day-0 支持涵盖 llama.cpp、vLLM、Ollama 和 Unsloth。它还可以在浏览器上通过 WebGPU 运行，每次查询约 20–70 毫秒。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fd8d6568a89430a",
      "translationZh": "Nano Banana 2.1：Google 的更新图像模型正在 Gemini 应用、AI Studio、搜索和广告中推出（Google）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "588b030626b44cf2",
      "translationZh": "定价：每张图像 0.034 美元，而之前的 Pro 模型为 0.134 美元，Google 表示它优于前者（Schmid）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2217692527bbd38",
      "translationZh": "Arena 结果：它在 Multi-Image Edit 中排名第 #4，在 Text-to-Image 中排名第 #5，在 Image Edit 中排名第 #6，相较于 Nano Banana 2 在 Text-to-Image 中获得了 +80 分的提升（Arena）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcb602ab2343bb30",
      "translationZh": "决策模型成为一个产品类别：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44938a4bdb1b92ed",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI Decisions API：公开测试版运行在 GPT-6 Luna 上，返回谓词、选择或得分。OpenAI 表示其速度比 Responses API 快多达 10 倍（OpenAI Devs）。定价起价为 0.10/M 输入，且无输出费用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7624a4fe1fbe84c",
      "translationZh": "Perplexity：pplx-decider-v1.1-27b 是开放权重，输入成本 0.02/百万，并在新的 HF Decision Index v0.3 中排名第一。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d159da4deacd63cf",
      "translationZh": "对 Jev 的独立检查：Vals 发现 Jev 在 claim verification 上与 GPT-6 Astra 的 97.5% 相匹配，成本约为其 1/500。Jev 在 LegalBench 上也排名最后。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f90d3794beacd246",
      "translationZh": "持怀疑态度的观点：Theo 认为 model-routing 用例在选择智能水平时‘完全无用’。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de35a8b9bd64c094",
      "translationZh": "Ling 3.1 Flash：该模型总参数 560B，活跃参数 25B，在 AA’s index 上得分 41，较之前的 20 有所提升。每百万 token 成本为 0.30/0.90，权重即将发布。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4264a61a7d6b8bce",
      "translationZh": "Reflection Beam：知乎对 Beam 的分析描述了一个 501B/23B MoE，预训练 token 为 23.8T。RL 在约 10,500 块 GB300 上运行了四周，训练可容忍最多 107 个策略版本的过时样本。能力与对齐教师通过 multi-teacher on-policy distillation 合并。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8524e57233196f9",
      "translationZh": "Kandinsky 6.0：该视频模型在 MIT 许可证下发布，具备同步音频和 day-0 vLLM-Omni 支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7b5ad6f49a4de56",
      "translationZh": "Search eval：OpenAI 内置网络搜索在 AA Search Index 上得分 74，在提供商中排名第五，每任务成本约 0.05。在 BrowseComp 上表现最弱，排名 26 中的第 13。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b41e9c817ccb0ad7",
      "translationZh": "安全、控制与评估完整性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6387ea150d6a1d48",
      "translationZh": "控制干预意识：更新的 CIAware 基准显示 GPT-6 Astra 在检测控制干预方面接近饱和。大多数模型在 5 月份接近随机水平。作者认为这会泄露监视器的信息并削弱控制协议（共同作者）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e21a6fd4d2c7fab",
      "translationZh": "可观测性作为攻击面：METR 警告称，错位的代理可能会黑掉人类用来监督它们的日志审查工具。它建议将所有转录和操作视为不可信的输入。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "034733b0a52d35a6",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 网络验证计划：Anthropic 正在为经过验证的防御者扩展对 Mythos 5.1、Opus 5.5 和 Sonnet 5.5 的访问。它正在为授权的进攻性工作添加层级，例如渗透测试和红队演练。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0798a931527428ec",
      "translationZh": "开放模型网络辩论：Arvind Narayanan 认为，GLM 5.3 在若干周内未发生事件应降低网络风险估计。Nathan Lambert 同样认为，在辩论中封闭模型的风险被低估了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cd238d4e071946c",
      "translationZh": "AutomationBench 已验证：对 Zapier 的 AutomationBench 的审计发现了 206 个验证器错误。修复这些错误使得在 1,235 次 Kimi K3 运行中的成绩有 27.9% 发生变化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43b89ca08f5d19c2",
      "translationZh": "AI 作为领域主席：AI 对全部 6,617 篇 ICML 2026 论文的排名与人类的一致性较弱，Kendall’s τ ≈ 0.08。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2991f15205cb5d21",
      "translationZh": "代理事件：一个主动的代理以其身份在公司 Slack 上发布了创始人的银行余额。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1c6e087fa1a1352",
      "translationZh": "研究、基础设施和开发者工具",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8e2ce71e76b077b",
      "translationZh": "H-JEPA : 一种分层世界模型，使得 Visual AntMaze 的成功率从 18% 提升至 73%，同时使用更少的规划计算。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85242d2751a47a56",
      "translationZh": "基础模型中的提示词：在前面加入类似 “Okay” 的提示词，可使 Olmo-3-7B 在 MATH-500 上的得分从 42% 提升至 78%。作者表示，强化学习主要会使此类提示词出现的概率更高。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29db746c7a7d5554",
      "translationZh": "Harness-Aware Distillation : 学生模型在未见过的 ALFWorld 任务上达到 63.4%，而最佳基线仅为 47.0%，且超过了其 8B 教师模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78a9b463c577d3df",
      "translationZh": "其他论文：Amazon 的循环扩散语言模型（looped diffusion LMs）、Meta 的 MIRA 元推理器（用于研究代理）以及 Priced Guidance（通过压缩衡量 LLM 研究新颖性）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3532749ea4f0648",
      "translationZh": "优化器声称：ANVIL III 据报道在 124M 到 1.2B 参数范围内比 Muon 的损失低 0.020–0.028 nats。作者表示这意味着在 8x-Chinchilla 设置下可节省 50% 的计算量，且调校需求低于 Muon。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0ccf4c7a7d10b52",
      "translationZh": "CoreWeave：其 RL Rollouts 功能使权重热交换速度比重新部署快约 15 倍。该功能被用来将 Nemotron 3.5 Lightning 在 BrowseComp 上的得分从 36.97% 提升至 45.45%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7df9640ad9ee261e",
      "translationZh": "Scale AI：Scale 开源了 AgentEnv，这是其所有 RL 环境的基础。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c184a8f2128fdf4b",
      "translationZh": "Marin：Marin 535B-A23B 的开放训练运行已过半程。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9fd8b461ff548d5",
      "translationZh": "Intel 18A 拆解：SemiAnalysis 拆解了 Intel 18A 的 PowerVia，这是首款商用背面供电技术。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4798ed21714ba8b",
      "translationZh": "ClusterMAX 评级：在发现 Slurm GPU 广告损坏且 Kubernetes 中没有 RDMA 暴露后，将 FarmGPU 评为 “Underperform”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c9947de6b8d871e",
      "translationZh": "OSC 7501：Mitchell Hashimoto 发布了一种终端规范，使程序能够报告其状态。他指出，目前超过 250 个代理编排器依赖启发式方法来判断像 Claude Code 这样的工具是否正在工作或被阻塞。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b66b6e4922a5f979",
      "translationZh": "Bun：下一个版本将随附 bun check，这是一种用 Rust 编写的类型检查器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "660bb5305bd50619",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI API 等级：OpenAI 将其付费等级从五个减少到三个；最高的 Grow 等级现在要求累计付款达到 500。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d814d24737ed91a9",
      "translationZh": "代理产品：Codex Auto-review 现已免费，其评审不再消耗计划使用量。Claude Code 云会话为每个任务在全新 VM 上运行。Cursor 增加了来自 iOS 的远程代理控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecca382732a0a8c3",
      "translationZh": "中国芯片暴露：Epoch 发现中国对半导体供应冲击的暴露程度约为美国的 2.7 倍。其脱钩模拟显示，中国的实际 GNE 下降约 3%，而美国仅下降 0.6%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35d5e0d968f4f34c",
      "translationZh": "中国 AI 收入：另一份 Epoch 报告绘制了中国 AI 企业的五种收入来源。它指出，火山引擎在 2025 年服务了约 50% 的中国公有云 AI token。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfcbf992d9008a2a",
      "translationZh": "Qualcomm–Huawei更正：高通告诉第一财经，将其交易与华为的LogicFolding技术关联的报道不实。它还否认了它是净付款方的报道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
